      "content": "It's clear you're in a deep place of despair, and that feeling of being a burden is a very heavy weight to carry. But those feelings are distortions of reality; your children are resilient, and they don't see you as a mistake. Their love for you is unconditional, and your presence, even when you struggle, is a part of their life story. Please consider speaking with a therapist who can help you manage these intense feelings of worthlessness.",
