    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, but it doesn't change the reality. every day feels like i'm just stealing from their future and their happiness. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to deal with the stress of watching me fall apart. i just want them to have a chance at a life that isn't heavy and dark like mine. sometimes it feels like the only kind thing i could actually do is just stop being part of the equation.",
